    credit: "Boris Carmi / Meitar Collection / National Library of Israel / The Pritzker
      Family National Photography Collection \xB7 CC BY 4.0 \xB7 graded and cropped"
    sensitive: 0
    sensitivityReviewed: 0
  - eventId: first_truce
    image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: e52b94b9d64f24bafa07294fd5068c17, type: 3}
    alt: A quiet, tree-lined street in Jerusalem during a pause in the fighting,
