    credit: "Moshe Marlin Levin / Meitar Collection / National Library of Israel
      / The Pritzker Family National Photography Collection \xB7 CC BY 4.0 \xB7 graded
      and cropped"
    sensitive: 0
    sensitivityReviewed: 0
  - eventId: iraqi_exodus
    image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 500a6138a65cb4b94a22c47acc06c71c, type: 3}
    alt: Children newly arrived from Iraq at a reception table with bread, oranges
