    credit: "Benno Rothenberg / Meitar Collection / National Library of Israel /
      The Pritzker Family National Photography Collection \xB7 CC BY 4.0 \xB7 graded
      and cropped"
    sensitive: 0
    sensitivityReviewed: 0
  - eventId: israel_bonds
    image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: a4ce290bdab3342189da25741919d8d8, type: 3}
    alt: David Ben-Gurion and Abba Eban present a menorah to President Harry Truman
