    credit: "Abbie Rowe, National Park Service / U.S. National Archives (NARA 200318)
      \xB7 public domain \xB7 graded and cropped"
    sensitive: 0
    sensitivityReviewed: 0
  - eventId: jerusalem_ceasefire
    image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: df224a98a048241d9a46dfc713802e5e, type: 3}
    alt: Tank traps and roadblocks on Shmuel HaNavi Street, on the line between Israeli-
