    credit: "Willem van de Poll, Nationaal Archief (Van de Poll 255-0327) \xB7 CC0
      \xB7 graded and cropped"
    sensitive: 0
    sensitivityReviewed: 0
  - eventId: jerusalem_military_government
    image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 58b9f14a3ed1e4a9aba4e8a649be050a, type: 3}
    alt: One of Israel's first policemen directs traffic on Ussishkin Street, Jerusalem,
