      The Pritzker Family National Photography Collection \xB7 CC BY 4.0 \xB7 graded
      and cropped"
    sensitive: 0
    sensitivityReviewed: 0
  - eventId: maabarot_policy
    image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 30e66f07968ea470285400148cdda3ec, type: 3}
    alt: Immigrant women and children inside a large tent at a ma'abara on the road
