    credit: "Benno Rothenberg / Meitar Collection / National Library of Israel /
      The Pritzker Family National Photography Collection \xB7 CC BY 4.0 \xB7 graded
      and cropped"
    sensitive: 0
    sensitivityReviewed: 0
  - eventId: operation_hiram
    image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: abf15c791a3374e62806e9976b5537e5, type: 3}
    alt: A soldier sweeps a Galilee road for mines after Operation Hiram, 1948.
    credit: "Boris Carmi / Meitar Collection / National Library of Israel / The Pritzker
